{"seq":17,"slug":"technical-program-management","title":"技术项目管理 (TPM)","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 技术项目管理 (TPM) 简介\n\n技术项目管理（Technical Program Management，简称 TPM）是一门融合技术深度与项目管理能力的跨领域学科。在当今大规模软件系统和复杂技术生态中，TPM 角色已成为连接工程团队、产品团队与业务目标之间的关键纽带。\n\nTPM 不同于传统的项目管理（PM）或工程管理（EM）。传统 PM 侧重流程和交付物管理，EM 聚焦于人员和技术决策，而 TPM 则横跨两者——既需要理解系统架构和技术复杂度，又需要驾驭跨组织的协调与推动。这种独特的定位使得 TPM 在 Google、Meta、Amazon、字节跳动等技术公司中扮演着不可或缺的角色。\n\n本知识库从四个维度系统梳理 TPM 的核心知识体系：\n\n第一章**TPM 角色与核心能力**，明确 TPM 的职责定义、能力模型以及与相邻角色的边界划分，帮助读者建立对 TPM 定位的清晰认知。\n\n第二章**项目规划与执行**，深入探讨路线图制定、里程碑管理、跨团队协调和依赖管理等核心实践，覆盖从启动到交付的完整执行链路。\n\n第三章**风险管理与沟通**，聚焦技术风险评估框架、干系人管理策略、状态报告机制与问题升级路径，构建 TPM 在不确定性中保持项目可控的能力。\n\n第四章**规模化与度量**，讨论大型项目和项目组合管理方法、OKR/KPI 度量体系以及复盘与持续改进机制，适用于成熟 TPM 应对组织级挑战的场景。\n\n本知识库适合已有一定技术背景、希望系统性提升项目管理能力的工程师，也适合正在向 TPM 角色转型或已在 TPM 岗位上寻求进阶的从业者。无论你是在初创团队管理首个跨团队项目，还是在大厂主导百人级的技术项目，都能在这里找到可落地的方法论与实践参考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"role-and-competency","title":"TPM 角色与核心能力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/role-and-competency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"role-definition-and-boundaries","title":"TPM 角色定义与职责边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/role-and-competency/role-definition-and-boundaries"},{"seq":2,"slug":"competency-model-and-growth","title":"TPM 能力模型与成长路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/role-and-competency/competency-model-and-growth"},{"seq":3,"slug":"work-patterns-and-daily-practice","title":"TPM 工作模式与日常实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/role-and-competency/work-patterns-and-daily-practice"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"planning-and-execution","title":"项目规划与执行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/planning-and-execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"roadmap-and-milestone-planning","title":"路线图与里程碑规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/planning-and-execution/roadmap-and-milestone-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-team-coordination-and-dependencies","title":"跨团队协调与依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/planning-and-execution/cross-team-coordination-and-dependencies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"execution-tracking-and-delivery","title":"执行跟踪与交付保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/planning-and-execution/execution-tracking-and-delivery"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-management-and-communication","title":"风险管理与沟通","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/risk-management-and-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-risk-assessment","title":"技术风险评估与缓解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/risk-management-and-communication/technical-risk-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stakeholder-management-and-reporting","title":"干系人管理与状态报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/risk-management-and-communication/stakeholder-management-and-reporting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"escalation-and-decision-facilitation","title":"问题升级与决策推动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/risk-management-and-communication/escalation-and-decision-facilitation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"scaling-and-metrics","title":"规模化与度量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/scaling-and-metrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"large-program-and-portfolio-management","title":"大型项目与组合管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/scaling-and-metrics/large-program-and-portfolio-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"okr-kpi-and-effectiveness-metrics","title":"OKR/KPI 与效能度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/scaling-and-metrics/okr-kpi-and-effectiveness-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"retrospective-and-continuous-improvement","title":"复盘与持续改进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-program-management/scaling-and-metrics/retrospective-and-continuous-improvement"}]}]}